# Worker variables are configured in wrangler.jsonc or Cloudflare dashboard.
# Set ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN, ACCESS_AUD, BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL before deployment.
# RESEND_API_KEY (secret), RESEND_FROM (verified sender)
# MSG91_AUTHKEY (secret), MSG91_TEMPLATE_ID (approved discreet reminder template)
# India SMS sending also requires the sender's MSG91/DLT setup.
